Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.450
Nijigaoka?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.020
Amano

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.860
I came back home.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.610
I need to liven up.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.690
I can't be looking so gloomy.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.150
Yes?

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.040
Open up, Papa. It's Ichigo.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.100
What!? Ichigo!?

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.560
It's really, really you!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.910
Hey, everyone! It's Ichigo! Ichigo came back home!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.260
Eh? Why's she back?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.320
Ichigo, welcome home!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.670
I'm back.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:26.290
You must be cold, come inside!

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:31.140
Don't tell me, Ichigo's quitting the academy just like that?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:37.150
recipe 10

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:37.150
Strawberry Tart of Memories

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:40.140
Actually, Ichigo-chan can't be found anywhere.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:47.940
I searched around the campus and her luggage has been taken along, so I think she left.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:48.960
Seriously?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.050
Back then...

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:52.440
As you are now, we won't make it past the first round.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.360
You're greatly mistaken if you think you can win with just efforts alone.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.330
No way...

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.210
She must have been really hurt by that.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.340
Geez...

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.120
She gets reprimanded a little and then runs away.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.930
She won't fit in the harsh world of a pâtissier.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.440
Even though she's used to getting it from Kashino but,

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.440
being told off by Andou and I who are usually nice to her,

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.710
must have been quite a shock.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.550
You guys are really...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.940
This is bad! It's almost the curfew time for the dorm.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.320
What should we do?

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.200
If she ends up staying outside without permission, she'll definitely be expelled!

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.500
That's troubling.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:28.850
Kashino?

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.560
Here's your Papa's specialty omelet rice!

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.530
Now, eat up!

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.010
I'll make more if that's not enough!

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.370
Itadakimasu!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.650
Delicious!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.040
It is, right?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.330
If you had called, we would've picked you up from the train station.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:48.180
It must have been really cold, wasn't it?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.580
Or rather, why did you come home, Onee-chan?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.040
Oh well, it's early winter break.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:58.370
Eh? Is it already?

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:02.540
How do I say, those French schools really do things differently.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.950
Have you gotten a little fatter, Onee-chan?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:11.140
I bet you're guzzling up sweets everyday since Mama isn't there to check on you.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:14.470
Natsume, you're getting 10 knuckle bombs for saying that!

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:17.440
No, not that! Forgive me!

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.050
How boisterous and lively.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.450
Families should be just like this!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.910
Mama, get me a beer!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.710
Okay, okay.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:29.450
Could that be...

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.800
Yes, this is Amano.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.510
Ah, thank you for taking care of her.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.170
Yes? Oh, is that so.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:41.710
I knew it. It's from the Academy.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:42.830
Yes, right.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.950
Then, we'll be sure to do that the next time...

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.850
My sincere apologies.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.010
Goodbye.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.490
That was the dorm superintendent.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:55.400
They said that you should submit your notification of absence sooner next time.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.250
Notification of absence?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.710
I didn't submit anything like that though.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:04.400
Then what was this early winter break you mentioned?

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.930
Umm, well...

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.580
I'm sorry, I lied!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.300
So in short, you're having trouble with your friends, right?

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.070
Yeah.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:23.130
That means you ran away without making up with them, right?

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:23.730
Yeah.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.730
That's not like you at all.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.380
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.370
Well, just leave it be.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.470
Just quit that far-away school!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.070
Darling...

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:36.060
I am going to quit St. Marie Academy.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.270
Are you seriously saying that, Onee-chan?

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.980
Ichigo...

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:46.280
It's great that I got in that school, but I just keep messing up every single day.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.650
Yes, your Papa knows your clumsiness really well.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:53.980
And in the rare occasion that I was complimented, a disagreement broke out.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.000
You do have a tendency to get carried away at times.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.640
And you too, darling.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:03.090
I think I might not be suited for that school.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.620
Yes, yes! I won't object to your decisions!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.800
My little fledgling can rest in her Papa's arms!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:11.560
Darling... Can you at least understand the situation a bit now?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.390
Ichigo has a really warm family.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:18.900
It's a weekend after all, how about going for a drive tomorrow?

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.960
A drive?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:22.570
Yeah.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.400
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.300
Where's Ichigo?

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.700
I left her behind!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.970
Onee-chan's always slow with her preparations.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.810
Thanks for wa-

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.780
Where are we going?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.030
I thought we should visit Hikaru Ojisan occasionally too.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.870
Are we going to grandma's shop?

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.190
You guessed it.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.550
The shop that my grandma started...

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:59.070
It has been a year now since it was taken over by her eldest son, Hikaru Ojisan.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:04.020
I haven't seen him since grandma passed away.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.250
It's been so long, I really want to eat those strawberry tarts.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:14.170
Whenever I was feeling down and crying, grandma always gave me one to eat.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:19.680
With just a single bite, a smile would return to my face, like magic.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.540
When I ate that, I definitely cheered up from the bottom of my heart.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.260
It will clear my depression for sure.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.150
Vanilla?

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.760
Huh? What's the matter?

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:34.290
Uh, I just suddenly felt like having vanilla ice cream!

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.680
Or something...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.410
Did I really see Vanilla?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.990
It couldn't be, right...

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.500
Ichigo's Mama drives so roughly.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.080
We haven't been out for a long drive in a while. It's tiring.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:57.260
You were just snoring away, right?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.680
Well, it's quite tiring to sleep in a sitting position too.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.170
Closed

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.340
What a disaster. This shop has finally been forced to close down.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.300
That can't be!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:14.900
Wild Strawberry

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:30.020
And we came all the way here too...

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:38.060
Hey, Shigeru.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.390
Hikaru-niichan!

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.490
Where were you just looking to come to that conclusion?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.790
Uh, nothing.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.330
Anyway, thanks for coming such a long way.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.150
Good afternoon...

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.720
If it isn't Ichigo and Na-chan!

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.390
You've grown so much lately.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.660
Is your Ojisan's head too dazzling?

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.190
Is it a rest day for the shop today?

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:01.800
No. It's just that everything I made this morning was sold out in two hours.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.240
Wow, isn't that a great success?

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:06.170
What's with the rough bike?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.340
Oh, that?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.560
There are many elderly people around here,

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:14.170
so I make deliveries on my bike to those who can't come here.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.450
Thank you.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.490
The coffee smells good!

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:22.710
I just made a delivery to Matsumoto-san, who had strained his back.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.520
And you have to run the store, too. That must be hard on you.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:29.940
Well in a way, this is the local store that the neighbourhood depends on after all.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:36.260
And here we get fresh milk straight from the farm and fruits from the orchard, too.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.740
It has its advantages.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.890
From the orchard? What's happened to the strawberry garden in the back?

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:45.020
Well, I wasn't suited for that.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:46.370
The whole patch died.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.310
Onee-chan! Hey, Onee-chan!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.500
Here's your coffee.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:18.120
Ichigo, I heard you got in St. Marie Academy, just like grandma did.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.840
The training may be tough, but your skills will definitely improve.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:24.320
Umm, well, about that...

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:29.790
Well then, I better start preparing for the afternoon business.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.880
Oh, that's right...

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.540
Ichigo and Na-chan. How would you both like to help out?

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.250
We will go for a stroll then.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.260
Alright, shall we go?

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.470
Bye, do your best!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.270
It's a little big, isn't it?

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:51.530
Cool! This is the same uniform grandma wore!

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.310
What can we do to help?

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.880
It looks pretty good on you!

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.170
Really?

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:02.380
But I've never made sweets before...

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.330
Don't worry. I'll help you.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.450
You'll  help?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.380
Yeah!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.440
That's not very assuring though.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.900
Have you both washed your hands?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.190
Yes!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:20.430
Then start by separating the egg whites from the yolks.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.440
These eggs!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.760
All of it?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.950
You can use these egg separators.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.640
I've never used anything like this...

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.080
Natsume, you do it like this.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.340
Wow! The yolk is separated from the white so easily.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.050
How about trying it, Natsume?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.000
I did it!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.150
Yay!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.440
I did it!

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:49.770
I really, actually did it!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:01.210
We're done.

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.040
Hikaru Ojisan seems to be running wild over there though...

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.230
Oh, that?

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:09.180
He's just smashing the roasted walnuts.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.700
See, there's the sweet fragrance.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.470
You're right!

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.770
Have you finished?

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.980
Then Ichigo sift the wheat flour and Na-chan do the sugar.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.930
There's so much of it again!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.490
A pâtissier has so much manual labor to do.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.170
You're tired already?

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.140
No! I'm not done yet!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.440
I'll just go get more sugar.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.570
Vanilla...

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:53.950
Were you worried about me?

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.230
That's because you ran away all of a sudden.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.610
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.520
I got carried away, right?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.570
I'm reflecting on my actions.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.940
No, I'm sorry for saying such mean things as well.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.380
My partner has to be Ichigo after all.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:13.290
Why are you laughing to yourself?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.170
Are you really enjoying all this work?

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:19.780
In the first place, the sugar and flour are in powdered form, right?

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.380
Is it necessary to sift them?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.640
Oh, about that.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:28.330
If the powder clumps up, you can't mix the ingredients well, right?

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.270
That will affect the texture.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:33.330
And also, air gets trapped in the powder during sifting.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.330
That air helps make it fluffy.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.490
Oh, is that so!

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:45.570
It might be troublesome but if you put in the effort, it'll show in the sweets you make.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.390
You look like you're really enjoying yourself when you're making sweets, Onee-chan.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:54.650
Right now you seem, uh... Like you're sparkling with radiance!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.930
Really? I'm sparkling with radiance?

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.770
Yes? What is it?

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.770
You called?

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.540
Ah, no.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:09.230
Well, now the batter is ready. We'll spread these out and bake cookies.

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:13.830
This orange batter has carrot paste in it for babies.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.470
These are for soy flour cookies. Pipe them out with a pastry bag and they'll be very soft.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.980
That way, even Kawada-jichan who has fake teeth can eat all he wants.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.390
This one has soy pulp and seaweed in it.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.090
That's for the pregnant Tanabe-san.

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:29.420
This has reduced sugar for Shimizu-san who's on a diet.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:32.200
And this is prepared for Lucky, a miniature dachshund.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.870
Wow, you even have a doggy as a customer!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:38.570
Na-chan, use the cookie cutters and Ichigo, I leave the piping to you.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:39.260
Right!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.520
Your Ojisan is an amazing pâtissier that equals your grandma, isn't he?

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:48.470
Yeah. The atmosphere of the shop has changed wonderfully from grandma's time but...

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:52.970
In his own way, Ojisan has made it flourished.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.430
Good job!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.930
Thanks to you two, the preparations finished 30 minutes faster than usual.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.850
Yes! Thank you!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.120
Go ahead. You can have the snacks you like!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.400
Onee-chan is the champion for a cake eating competition though!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.890
Oh, well have... about 10 pieces?

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:53.050
Alright!

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.140
Itadakimasu!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:58.110
Ah! These are the cookies I cut out!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:00.600
Delicious!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.130
The ones you made yourself taste even more fantastic, right?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:03.620
Yes!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.130
That looks delicious.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:11.290
Its a strawberry tart grandma used to make.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:15.610
With just a bite, it's magical charm will blow away all your worries.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.320
How is it?

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.050
It tastes different.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:23.620
This is of course <i>delicious</i> as well, but...

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.080
But it isn't grandma's strawberry tart.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.920
Could you have forgotten how it tastes after so long?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.610
No, I would definitely remember.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.350
Ojisan, did you change the flavour of this tart?

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.680
It has a richer buttery flavour compared with before...

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.310
It's impressive that you noticed that.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:43.690
I used cultured fermented butter. It's my original tart creation.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:49.600
Well, when I first took over this shop, I tried to follow the taste of grandma's tart.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:52.080
It was a popular tart after all.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.920
However, I could never figure out the recipe.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.860
The recipe?

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.850
What's this?

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.030
Her recipe notebook.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:09.750
It's filled with grandma's memories and the recipe for the strawberry tart.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:14.390
But I never found the key, so I can't read it.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.070
The key?

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.780
Grandma left it behind and I didn't want to break it.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:22.590
So nobody can read it anymore.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:25.390
Did you like grandma's strawberry tart?

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:27.450
Yes, I loved it!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.020
But, I like yours too, Ojisan...

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.710
Children don't have to be so thoughtful.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.780
But truly, I do...

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.310
I'll give you this notebook, Ichigo.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:38.890
No, I can't accept such an important...

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:42.770
I have completed my own tart.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.640
So, I won't be needing it anymore.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:48.230
Moreover, I feel that grandma would be pleased for you to have it.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.240
I guess it's no good without a key, right?

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:16.490
And that tart's recipe has been on my mind, too.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.850
But just holding onto it is good enough.

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:25.150
It feels strangely calming to be sharing grandma's treasure.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:30.240
Nevertheless, I would have loved to try your grandma's strawberry tart.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:34.070
Not a problem. I'll definitely let you try it.

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:34.880
Really?

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:36.050
Of course.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.230
I'm sorry, Mama. Head to the nearest station!

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:46.780
Where did you think I'm driving to now?

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.800
Your bags are in the trunk.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.610
Mama!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.620
St. Marie Academy Entrance

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:01.360
Ichigo, if you feel like you're about to be crushed, it's fine just be crushed.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.840
But in return, make sure you recover from it.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:08.130
By repeating that, you'll grow little by little.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.770
Thanks, Mama.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:17.300
Yay! We're back at the academy.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:22.780
I'll study really hard and make many people smile with my sweets!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.860
So I'll...

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:28.100
Thank goodness, you're back.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.430
Umm, I...

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.480
Sorry!

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:35.180
We said such mean things to you without considering your feelings.

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:37.430
We've reflected on our actions since then.

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:41.470
I have to apologise, too. I'm really sorry.

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:44.860
Then, we'll shake hands and make up.

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:53.150
You're back already. It's almost the dorm curfew time.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.320
Kashino...

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:59.200
Kashino submitted a fake notification of absence to the dorm superintendent, covering up for you.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.820
That was his cunning work.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:01.920
Shut up.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.290
Sorry... Thanks, Kashino.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.920
Well, this time, I've said a little too much as well.

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.140
We only have 9 minutes till curfew!

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.910
Everyone, run!

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:18.040
I'm back! St. Marie Academy...

